          "snippet": "The potential method  4  ,  5  relies on the fact that a harmonic potential has the form U ( x ) =   kx 2 and the associated position probability distribution of the particle is   . Therefore, by sampling ρ ( x ) it is possible to reconstruct U ( x ) = − k B T ln( ρ ( x )) and   .",
